```

Make sure `using System.Diagnostics.CodeAnalysis;` is present (check first - it's already at line 8).

Then check all places that instantiate `GenericOperationSource<T>` (likely in ArmOperation.cs) and ensure the `T` there also has the annotation propagated.

## 5. ArmClientBuilderExtensions.cs - Fix IL2026/IL3050 (line 30)

Line 30 calls `builder.RegisterClientFactory<ArmClient, ArmClientOptions>(configuration)` which is annotated with `[RequiresUnreferencedCode]` and `[RequiresDynamicCode]`. 

Since this method fundamentally relies on configuration binding (which requires dynamic code), mark the method with the appropriate attributes:
